# Model delegation (this repo)

When spawning subagents (`Task`), pick the model from the task type:

| Task type | Model |
|-----------|--------|
| Routine: keep-awake/power scripts, git push, tests, small fixes, status checks, formatting | `composer-2.5` or `composer-2.5-fast` |
| Implementation, architecture, ANC app / noisecancellator features | `cursor-grok-4.7-xhigh-fast` |

Prefer the faster Composer model for clearly mechanical work; use Grok for anything that needs deep coding or system design in this project.

# Concurrency

At most 3 agents run at once, including the parent. Spawn at most 2 additional subagents. Prefer serial work when memory is tight.
